For every OS, you have some triggers/hooks whenever a file is read by another system. You need to have a log of these events, probably assign to some JSON file. With Jupyter, you have a SQLite database.

Why do we need this? Provenance for sure and reproducability, but also you have agents now, and you need some accountability of what happened.

When you want to write a paper or report of what you did, you can have an AI create a summary: create latex or markdown of what you did. Maybe later, we can define some profiles.

